# Tetris, driven from a script. `seed` fixes which pieces come, so this file
# is the whole of the run — including which two shapes happen to fill a row.

seed 10
frame                # the first piece, an I, over the middle

key left             # push it to the wall
tick 5000            # and let it fall the height of the well
frame

key right            # the next one, an O, goes to the other side
key right
tick 5000
frame                # six cells across: the row goes, and the score moves

key q
